  "title": "CBIC Expands AI and EMI Scheme for MSMEs",
  "summary": "CBIC Chairman Vivek Chaturvedi announced plans to expand its AI and machine learning initiatives, while also launching a new EMI scheme for small businesses to reduce customs duties. The initiative aims to streamline the customs process and improve compliance for businesses.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "CBIC Chairman Vivek Chaturvedi announced plans to expand its AI and machine learning initiatives.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "The Central Board of Indirect Taxes and Customs (CBIC) will conduct outreach programmes and handhold MSMEs to encourage them to opt for the Eligible Manufacturer Importer (EMI) scheme.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "The EMI scheme allows businesses to defer customs duties without paying them.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    }
